{"id":"n40784-4-9","stage":3,"title":"놀리다 · 闲放","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40784-4-9-1","ko":"요즘도 많이 바쁘세요?","zh":"最近您还是非常忙吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘도","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘도","audio":"/audio/7afb6aa8f58b38f4cfb8.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"바쁘세요?","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바쁘세요","audio":"/audio/cfdca703c4f4eb8db43e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/47aedc75ce3184923b8d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40784-4-9-2","ko":"바쁘긴요. 일이 없어 공장의 기계들을 마냥 놀리고 있는 걸요.","zh":"哪有忙啊。因为没什么活儿，工厂的机器就一直闲置着呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바쁘긴요.","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바쁘긴요","audio":"/audio/089bca371ce411ef1b85.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"없어","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}},{"text":"공장의","meaning":"厂，工厂","explanation":"공장：厂，工厂；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"공장","audio":"/audio/19d82475f0166d702ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62411","senseId":"1","lemma":"공장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공장의","audio":"/audio/3cf38e04aa4ecf234cf5.mp3"}},{"text":"기계들을","meaning":"机械，机器","explanation":"기계：机械，机器；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기계","audio":"/audio/5eb260fa2e31046f6526.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62451","senseId":"1","lemma":"기계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기계들을","audio":"/audio/4d5c24d5e1d385318519.mp3"}},{"text":"마냥","meaning":"一直","explanation":"마냥：一直","readings":[{"term":"마냥","audio":"/audio/d2190ea517a326577d99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51528","senseId":"1","lemma":"마냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마냥","audio":"/audio/d2190ea517a326577d99.mp3"}},{"text":"놀리고","meaning":"闲放","explanation":"놀리다：闲放；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놀리다","audio":"/audio/f61038364c18d6de907b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40784","senseId":"4","lemma":"놀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀리고","audio":"/audio/45efd0c8a2d1c967c108.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"걸요.","meaning":"表示与对方想象不同的情况（礼貌语气）","explanation":"-는걸요：表示发现、感叹或与对方预期相反的情况。这里是“机器都闲着呢”，不是宾语助词 을。","readings":[{"term":"걸요","audio":"/audio/ea708874cee3db3cf82d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸요","audio":"/audio/ea708874cee3db3cf82d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"19d82475f0166d70","term":"공장","zh":"厂，工厂","audio":"/audio/19d82475f0166d702ebe.mp3","entryId":"62411","definition":"加工原料或材料制造物品的地方。","pronunciation":["공장"]},{"id":"5eb260fa2e31046f","term":"기계","zh":"机械，机器","audio":"/audio/5eb260fa2e31046f6526.mp3","entryId":"62451","definition":"做一定工作的工具或装置。","pronunciation":["기계","기게"]},{"id":"d2190ea517a32657","term":"마냥","zh":"一直","audio":"/audio/d2190ea517a326577d99.mp3","entryId":"51528","definition":"不管到什么时候，始终如一地。","pronunciation":["마냥"]},{"id":"f61038364c18d6de","term":"놀리다","zh":"闲放","audio":"/audio/f61038364c18d6de907b.mp3","entryId":"40784","definition":"不使用某个东西、设施或金钱等，就那么放着。","pronunciation":["놀리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、